---
/*
 * The one presentation of "the listing did not state it" (prd.md, Success Criteria → Guardrails):
 * an unstated fact is shown as unstated in muted italics, never as "no", `0` or an empty value.
 * Callers pass the wording; this component owns how it looks.
 */
---

<span class="text-muted-foreground italic">
  <slot />
</span>
